 小时"},{"icon":"camera","label":"拍照指数","value":"极高","level":5},{"icon":"mountain","label":"景观","value":"高","level":4},{"icon":"footprints","label":"步行强度","value":"轻松至中等","level":2},{"icon":"cloud-rain","label":"雨天适应度","value":"中等","level":3},{"icon":"users","label":"适合家庭","value":"非常好","level":5},{"icon":"gauge","label":"节奏","value":"轻松","level":3}],"galleryItems":[{"id":1,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/nami-island/nami-metasequoia-sunset-lake.webp","location":"南怡岛（南怡洲）","caption":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — photo 1","alt":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — gallery image 1"},{"id":2,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/nami-island/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-04.webp","location":"南怡岛（南怡洲）","caption":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — photo 2","alt":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — gallery image 2"},{"id":3,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/nami-island/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-05.webp","location":"南怡岛（南怡洲）","caption":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — photo 3","alt":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — gallery image 3"},{"id":4,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/nami-island/chatgpt-image-2026-5-11-01-12-05.webp","location":"南怡岛（南怡洲）","caption":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — photo 4","alt":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — gallery image 4"},{"id":5,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/garden-of-morning-calm-flowers.webp","location":"晨静树木园","caption":"晨静树木园 — photo 1","alt":"晨静树木园 — gallery image 1"},{"id":6,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/chatgpt-image-2026-5-10-10-36-31.webp","location":"晨静树木园","caption":"晨静树木园 — photo 2","alt":"晨静树木园 — gallery image 2"},{"id":7,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/chatgpt-image-2026-5-10-10-43-58.webp","location":"晨静树木园","caption":"晨静树木园 — photo 3","alt":"晨静树木园 — gallery image 3"},{"id":8,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/chatgpt-image-2026-5-11-01-09-33.webp","location":"晨静树木园","caption":"晨静树木园 — photo 4","alt":"晨静树木园 — gallery image 4"},{"id":9,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/petite-france/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-02.webp","location":"小法国村","caption":"小法国村 — photo 1","alt":"小法国村 — gallery image 1"},{"id":10,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/petite-france/petite-france-couple-colorful.webp","location":"小法国村","caption":"小法国村 — photo 2","alt":"小法国村 — gallery image 2"},{"id":11,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/petite-france/petite-france-ai-pastel-village.webp","location":"小法国村","caption":"小法国村 — photo 3","alt":"小法国村 — gallery image 3"}],"itineraryStops":[{"number":1,"time":"07:30 / 08:00","duration":"30 分钟接客时段","name":"接客（弘大入口站或明洞站）","category":"大巴接客","description":"接客地点为首尔两处集合点之一：**(1) 弘大入口站 8 号出口星巴克（麻浦区）** 07:30 — 星巴克店面就在 8 号出口上来的位置；或 **(2) 明洞站 2 号出口（中区）** 08:00 — 出口旁的 North Face 旗舰店是显眼地标。\n\n两处接客点共用同一辆空调大巴，弘大的客人先上车。请在所选集合点 **提前 5 分钟** 到达。这比 06:00 出发的雪岳山一日游明显从容 — 加平离首尔够近，大巴可以在首班地铁开行两小时之后再出发。\n\n上车时导游会发放韩英对照的行程卡，并确认当天的游览顺序、休息站与预计返回时间。从明洞出发后，大巴沿首尔—春川高速公路向东北行驶约 1.5 小时抵达加平码头。","image":null,"highlights":[],"timeUsed":["在所选接客点提前 5 分钟到达（约 5 分钟）","在标示的星巴克 / North Face 店前找到 AtoC Korea 大巴（约 5 分钟）","按接客顺序上车（约 10 分钟）","上车时发放韩英对照行程卡"],"whyOnRoute":"两处接客点覆盖首尔两大旅客聚集区：麻浦区的弘大一带，适合年轻与短期停留的旅客；以及中区明洞，围绕乐天、新罗与威斯汀酒店的老牌观光区。先弘大后明洞，是驶上首尔—春川高速公路向东北行的自然顺序。07:30 出发既不至于太赶，又足够早，能让大巴在 10:00 左右赶上南怡岛渡轮，抢在搭 ITX 列车前来的自由行旅客之前。","_poi_meta":null,"images":[],"imageCredits":[],"galleryItems":[]},{"name":"南怡岛（南怡洲）","time":"≈ 10:00","number":2,"category":"渡轮小岛&韩剧地标","duration":"120 分钟（2 小时）","timeUsed":["从加平码头乘渡轮过江（含排队5-10分钟）","沿水杉大道／银杏大道／韩国松林荫道自由漫步——半圈环岛路线约3公里","可选租用自行车（单人7,000韩元／双人14,000韩元，每小时）或乘坐电动蓝色小火车（单程3,000韩元，前往联合国儿童基金会纪念馆）","岛上小食休息（奏鸣曲咖啡厅、糖饼、红薯拿铁）","乘渡轮返回大陆"],"_poi_meta":{"poi_key":"nami_island","verified":true,"match":"single_poi","kb_version":"1.27","verified_date":"2026-04-29","sources":["Korea Tourism Organization (VisitKorea — Nami Island official listing + visa fee schedule)","Naminara Republic Official Site (namisum-en.imweb.me — own corpus on cultural-independence brand)","UNICEF Korea (Nami Island 2010 Child Friendly Park designation + International Children''s Book Festival)","KBS / Korea Times (Winter Sonata 2002 production retrospectives + Japanese tourism boom coverage)","Wikipedia (Namiseom — open corpus on General Nami history + Cheongpyeong Dam 1944 origin)"]},"highlights":["半月形江中岛,面积约 460,000 平方米/周长 5 公里;得名于朝鲜将领南怡(1441–1468)","标志性水杉大道——《冬季恋歌》(2002)经典取景地","自 2006 年起自创''南怡共和国''——自设国旗、货币、护照(旅游概念)","自加平码头 5 分钟轮渡(08:00–21:00,高峰每 10–20 分钟一班)","岛上动物:孔雀(含罕见白孔雀)、鸵鸟、野兔、松鼠","**1944 年成陆**,日本人修建的清平水坝抬升北汉江水位——闵丙焘于 1965 年购岛,1966 年创立京春观光开发公司","**南怡共和国于 2006 年 3 月 1 日宣布成立**,由姜禹铉社长以''文化独立''旅游品牌之名打造——韩国首个以微国家概念为载体的旅游品牌,自设国旗、货币、护照、邮票","**联合国儿童基金会儿童友好公园认证(2010 年)** + 南怡岛艺术与教育每年举办 **600 余场演出/展览/庆典**——单一韩国旅游目的地中颇为罕见","**签证费用**(韩国旅游公社 2026 年官方):普通 ₩19,000(往返轮渡)(单程含摩托艇 ₩29,000);36 个月以下幼儿免费;20 人以上团体享 9 折"],"smartNotes":{"photo":"水杉大道是《冬季恋歌》经典构图——秋季(10 月底至 11 月初金黄)或冬季(雪景)效果最佳。南岸的''恋人银杏树小径''更幽静,出片同样精彩。白孔雀偶尔出现在''恋人小径''附近。","facilities":"岛上餐厅供应韩式家常美味(糖饼、地瓜拿铁、烤牛肋饼)。Sonata 咖啡馆(韩屋风格)是招牌打卡店。加平码头设有受理外卡的售票柜台——自助售票机不接受外卡,请到柜台办理。","tip":"最佳季节:春季(4–5 月樱花)、秋季(10 月金黄银杏 + 红枫)、冬季(12–2 月雪后静谧小径,重现《冬季恋歌》氛围)。请避开周日下午的轮渡排队——建议 16:00 前离岛。Skyline 高空溜索(940 米,约 80 公里/小时,55,000–58,000 韩元含门票)在高峰时段可比轮渡省 15–20 分钟。"},"whyOnRoute":"南怡岛安排在一天之首，因为它是唯一一处“早光加分、人多减分”的停留点。这座半月形小岛的水杉与银杏大道是它的招牌，而在正午之前、搭乘 ITX 列车前来的自由行旅客与加平市区观光巴士还没塞满中央小径时，它们最上镜。把它放在最前面，也意味着渡江发生在清晨的平静里、而不是午后的风里；同时让这一天接下来先往内陆、再直接回家，不必折返。","convenience":{"restroom":"岛上与加平码头均设多间洗手间","parking":"加平码头小车 6,000 韩元 / 大型车 10,000 韩元(超过 12 小时每小时加收 1,000 韩元)"},"description":"南怡岛以自加平码头出发的 5 分钟轮渡开启一天行程,登上北汉江上一座半月形的江中岛。岛屿面积约 460,000 平方米(140,000 坪),周长约 5 公里,得名于朝鲜时期军事将领南怡(南怡,1441–1468),他在睿宗在位期间因被诬告谋反而 28 岁时遭处决。岛屿原本仅在洪水期才会浮出水面;1944 年日本殖民政府修建清平水坝,水位抬升后南怡岛永久成为江心岛。\n\n2002 年,KBS 电视剧《冬季恋歌》(裴勇俊、崔智友主演)在此取景,使其声名远播——成为 2000 年代初韩流浪潮的催化剂——延续至今每年吸引约 330 万名访客(其中 130 万为外国游客),是继首尔、釜山、济州之后韩国访客量最高的单一旅游目的地。**自 2006 年 3 月 1 日起**,该岛打造出''南怡共和国(Naminara Republic)''品牌,自设国旗、货币(南怡通宝币)、护照与邮政服务——这是一种旅游营销概念,而非真实政治实体。\n\n标志性的水杉大道(《冬季恋歌》经典雪景小径)、南岸的''恋人银杏树小径''、韩松小径,以及由烧酒瓶回收玻璃打造的 Sequoia Bridge,半日内即可悠然走完。截至 2016 年,岛上记录在案的 **年访客量达 330 万人,其中外国游客 130 万,来自 122 个国家**——是首尔、釜山、济州之后单一目的地中外国访客比例最高的景点。南怡岛特别面向 atockorea 的海外华人与东南亚客群配套了普通话/粤语/他加禄语/越南语标识。","visitBasics":{"hours":"渡轮 08:00 开航，末班进岛 21:00、末班出岛 21:05。09:00-18:00 每 10-20 分钟一班，其余时段每 30 分钟一班，航程约 5 分钟；岛上多数店铺 18:00 前打烊","closed":"全年开放","admission":"南怡共和国签证费，含往返渡轮：成人 ₩19,000 — 本行程已包含","walking":"轻松 — 平坦的林荫步道；半环岛路线约 3 公里，绕岛一圈约 5 公里。岛上可租自行车与电动代步车，不想走路的人可以使用。"},"image":"/images/tours/nami-island/nami-metasequoia-sunset-lake.webp","images":["/images/tours/nami-island/nami-metasequoia-sunset-lake.webp","/images/tours/nami-island/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-04.webp","/images/tours/nami-island/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-05.webp","/images/tours/nami-island/chatgpt-image-2026-5-11-01-12-05.webp"],"imageCredits":[{"url":"/images/tours/nami-island/nami-metasequoia-sunset-lake.webp","source":"atoc-korea"},{"url":"/images/tours/nami-island/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-04.webp","source":"atoc-korea"},{"url":"/images/tours/nami-island/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-05.webp","source":"atoc-korea"},{"url":"/images/tours/nami-island/chatgpt-image-2026-5-11-01-12-05.webp","source":"atoc-korea"}],"galleryItems":[{"id":1,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/nami-island/nami-metasequoia-sunset-lake.webp","location":"南怡岛（南怡洲）","caption":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — photo 1","alt":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — gallery image 1"},{"id":2,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/nami-island/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-04.webp","location":"南怡岛（南怡洲）","caption":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — photo 2","alt":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — gallery image 2"},{"id":3,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/nami-island/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-05.webp","location":"南怡岛（南怡洲）","caption":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — photo 3","alt":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — gallery image 3"},{"id":4,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/nami-island/chatgpt-image-2026-5-11-01-12-05.webp","location":"南怡岛（南怡洲）","caption":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — photo 4","alt":"南怡岛（南怡洲） — gallery image 4"}]},{"number":3,"time":"≈ 12:15","duration":"60 分钟","name":"加平午餐（费用自理）","category":"午餐时间","description":"南怡岛之后，大巴在加平码头一带的当地餐厅停留一小时。午餐 **不包含** — 你自行点餐付费，通常每人 ₩10,000-15,000。\n\n这里是辣炒鸡排的故乡：春川—加平一带正是 **辣炒鸡排（닭갈비）** 的发源地，甜辣鸡肉在桌上与卷心菜、红薯、年糕一起翻炒，最后通常用剩下的酱汁炒饭收尾。**荞麦冷面（막국수）** 是传统的搭配。素食选择有限，但一般都有拌饭；早上在车上告诉导游，他们会提前打电话预约。\n\n请带现金或信用卡 — 这一带多数餐厅两者都收，但码头附近的小摊常常只收现金。","image":null,"highlights":[],"timeUsed":["大巴停车，导游带队步行至餐厅（约 5 分钟）","点餐与用餐（约 45 分钟）","各自付款并回到车上集合（约 10 分钟）"],"whyOnRoute":"午餐放在南怡岛之后而不是之前，有两个原因。第一，这样能保住上午：先吃饭会把渡江时间推过正午、正好撞上人潮。第二，加平码头一带才是真正有餐厅的地方 — 晨静树木园在一条山谷公路上，周边几乎没有店家，小法国村园内也只有小吃摊。这一小时是全天最后一次能可靠坐下来吃饭的机会。","_poi_meta":null,"images":[],"imageCredits":[],"galleryItems":[]},{"name":"晨静树木园","time":"≈ 13:45","number":4,"category":"主题植物园","duration":"90 分钟","timeUsed":["司机兼导游带领入园并进行简短介绍（约5分钟）","在20个主题子花园中自由漫步（约50分钟）","可选：下沉花园（朝鲜半岛形状）延长拍照时间（约10分钟）","冬季游览：到达时间安排在17:00灯光秀开始之际，可同时欣赏白天花园景色与灯光节点亮瞬间","返回大巴集合（约5分钟）"],"_poi_meta":{"poi_key":"garden_of_morning_calm","verified":true,"match":"single_poi","kb_version":"1.27","verified_date":"2026-04-29","note":"POI verified in KB v1.10 (Batch 7) and reused here unchanged.","sources":["Garden of Morning Calm Official Site (morningcalm.co.kr — own corpus on founder + 1996 opening + 20 sub-gardens)","Korea Tourism Organization (VisitKorea — Lighting Festival listing + lighting-fest schedule)","Gyeonggi Cultural Foundation (ggc.ggcf.kr — official cultural promotion entry on Sunken Garden + 200,000 LEDs)","Sahmyook University Department of Horticulture (Prof. Han Sang-kyung honorary professor profile + garden origin)","Wikipedia (Garden of Morning Calm — corpus on Tagore-derived name + 5,000 species + 330,000 m² total)"]},"highlights":["韩国招牌私家树木园 —— 33万平方米,约5,000种植物","三育大学韩相敬创建;1996年开园(1992年构想)","冬季灯光节2025年12月5日–2026年3月15日,30,000余只LED(韩国首个自然环境灯光节)","20个主题分园 —— 形如朝鲜半岛的下沉花园、月光花园、盆景园、伊甸园","《云画的月光》等韩剧取景地","**1992年构思 / 1994年购地 / 1996年5月11日开园**:三育大学园艺系韩相敬教授与夫人亲自设计与栽培,早期资金困难时甚至卖掉家宅","**入选CNN韩国50大旅游胜地** —— 下沉花园的朝鲜半岛形构图(以10个大小花坛寄托统一愿景)是CNN提及的标志景观","**灯光节使用20万余只环保LED**(12–3月)—— 韩国首个自然环境灯光节;每晚17:00日落后开启","**圆柏(천년향)**为晨静树木园官方代表植物 —— 5,000种之中的招牌树种"],"smartNotes":{"photo":"春(4月樱花)、夏(满目青翠)、秋(10月至11月初秋叶)、冬(日落后灯光节)各有不同观感。灯光节期间的黄昏光之隧道为标志影像。","facilities":"Food Garden供应韩式家常(大酱汤、蔬菜拌饭、雪奶酪炒年糕)。\"Good Morning Coffee\"位于一座韩屋烘焙馆,是园内代表咖啡馆。餐厅20:00打烊。","tip":"灯光节期间(12月5日–3月15日)建议约16:00抵达先看白天的花园,再留至亮灯(约17:00之后)。2月暴雪时最为梦幻,如《冰雪奇缘》场景。"},"whyOnRoute":"晨静树木园是这一天的中段，也是最安静的一章 — 90 分钟足以走完主环线、经过下沉花园里那片韩半岛造型的花坛，还能找地方坐下来。它位于江边内陆的高处，所以必须排在南怡岛之后、回程之前；下午稍早造访也正好赶上园区一天中最暖的时候，这一点在 11 月到 3 月山谷积寒的季节尤其重要。","convenience":{"restroom":"多处,有指示牌","parking":"大型免费停车场;投币式存物柜1,500–2,000韩元(仅500韩元硬币)"},"description":"从南怡岛南行约30分钟,晨静树木园是韩国的招牌私家树木园——约33万平方米的精致景观,约5,000种植物。1992年构想、1996年向公众开放,由三育大学韩相敬教授亲自设计与栽种,他甚至一度变卖家宅以筹建项目;名字来自韩国\"朝鲜——晨静之地\"的旧称。园内20个主题分园——包含形如朝鲜半岛的\"下沉花园\"、故乡屋花园、盆景园、月光花园、天空之路、伊甸园等——各具视觉性格,亦是众多韩剧的取景地,例如《云画的月光》。\n\n每年12月初至次年3月中旬,园区举办韩国首个自然环境灯光节——2025–2026届为2025年12月5日至2026年3月15日,30,000余只LED铺满园区,日落后将花园化作冬日仙境。灯光节时段周日–五延长至11:00–21:00,周六11:00–23:00;非灯光节期为08:30–19:00,18:00停止入园。**\"Garden of Morning Calm\"**之名出自印度诗人泰戈尔1929年称韩国为\"晨静之国\"的诗句。\n\n韩相敬1992年于美国担任交换教授时萌发构想,被那里的世界级私家花园所启发。1994年购地——原为刀耕火种留下的荒石地。**韩教授与夫人亲自设计、亲手劳作**;经济困难时期,他们卖掉家宅,在园内一处小屋居住,以延续建设。1996年5月11日首次以10个主题区开园,如今已扩展至33万平方米、20个主题分园。","visitBasics":{"hours":"大致 08:30 至日落（通常 08:30-19:00），最后入园 18:00。冬季灯节期间园区开放至夜间 — 时间每季调整，导游会在车上确认当天的闭园时间","closed":"全年开放","admission":"成人 ₩11,000 — 本行程已包含","walking":"中等 — 起伏地形上的大量步道，穿行于各主题园区；主环线大致可推婴儿车通行"},"image":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/garden-of-morning-calm-flowers.webp","images":["/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/garden-of-morning-calm-flowers.webp","/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/chatgpt-image-2026-5-10-10-36-31.webp","/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/chatgpt-image-2026-5-10-10-43-58.webp","/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/chatgpt-image-2026-5-11-01-09-33.webp"],"imageCredits":[{"url":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/garden-of-morning-calm-flowers.webp","source":"atoc-korea"},{"url":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/chatgpt-image-2026-5-10-10-36-31.webp","source":"atoc-korea"},{"url":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/chatgpt-image-2026-5-10-10-43-58.webp","source":"atoc-korea"},{"url":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/chatgpt-image-2026-5-11-01-09-33.webp","source":"atoc-korea"}],"galleryItems":[{"id":1,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/garden-of-morning-calm-flowers.webp","location":"晨静树木园","caption":"晨静树木园 — photo 1","alt":"晨静树木园 — gallery image 1"},{"id":2,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/chatgpt-image-2026-5-10-10-36-31.webp","location":"晨静树木园","caption":"晨静树木园 — photo 2","alt":"晨静树木园 — gallery image 2"},{"id":3,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/chatgpt-image-2026-5-10-10-43-58.webp","location":"晨静树木园","caption":"晨静树木园 — photo 3","alt":"晨静树木园 — gallery image 3"},{"id":4,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/garden-of-morning-calm/chatgpt-image-2026-5-11-01-09-33.webp","location":"晨静树木园","caption":"晨静树木园 — photo 4","alt":"晨静树木园 — gallery image 4"}]},{"number":5,"time":"≈ 16:00","duration":"60 分钟","name":"小法国村","category":"小王子主题村","description":"作为当天行程紧凑的最后一站，小法国村是一座建于清平湖畔山坡上的法国文化主题村，距南怡岛约25分钟路程。该村由创始人韩洪燮于2008年7月开放，共有16栋建筑，以\"花、星与小王子\"（安托万·德·圣埃克苏佩里1943年著作《小王子》）为主题，设有圣埃克苏佩里纪念馆、奥尔格之家（收藏古董音乐盒，其中一件拥有200年历史至今仍可演奏）、法式住宅展览馆、木偶剧场，以及高卢雄鸡雕塑与绘画展廊。\n\n韩剧迷前来参观，主要是为了体验其韩剧拍摄地的魅力：小法国村曾是《贝多芬病毒》（2008）、《个人趣向》（2010）、《秘密花园》（2010）、《来自星星的你》（2013-2014）、2025年热播剧《陛下，请用餐》（玛丽之家曾作为林允儿饰演角色的房间）及热门综艺节目《Running Man》的取景地。\n\n毗邻的匹诺曹与达芬奇意大利村为有富余时间的游客提供联票选项。该景点已被选定为2026年韩法建交140周年纪念活动项目。\n\n该村具有双重功能：法国文化主题村 + **高城青少年培训中心**，可在4至10人间中容纳多达200名游客进行教育性住宿。\n\n该场地最具特色的建筑亮点是**法国传统民居展览馆**：整栋来自法国中部地区的19世纪法式农舍，被拆卸后运至此地，使用逾200年历史的木材、瓦片和砖块重新组装——完全采用法国传统木构榫卯技法，不用一颗钉子。\n\n小法国村也是**韩国唯一获得圣埃克苏佩里基金会授权的机构**，意味着场内所有小王子相关图案均已获法国圣埃克苏佩里基金会官方授权。\n\n毗邻的匹诺曹与达芬奇意大利村（单独购票或联票₩19,500成人）可将当天欧洲主题村的游览内容延伸约45分钟。","highlights":["2008年7月开放；16栋法式建筑，以\"小王子\"主题（圣埃克苏佩里，1943）为核心","韩剧取景记录：《贝多芬病毒》（2008）、《个人趣向》（2010）、《秘密花园》（2010）、《来自星星的你》（2013-14）、《陛下，请用餐》（2025）","奥尔格之家：馆藏逾200年历史音乐盒；木偶剧场每日定时演出","毗邻匹诺曹与达芬奇意大利村 — 联票成人₩19,500韩元","入选2026年韩法建交140周年纪念活动项目","**韩国唯一与法国圣埃克苏佩里基金会签订国际授权协议的机构** — 场内所有小王子相关图案均已获官方授权","**16栋建筑中包含一栋19世纪法式农舍**，由从法国中部地区进口的逾200年历史木材、瓦片和砖块重新组装，不用一颗钉子（法国传统木构技法）","**2025年韩剧《陛下，请用餐》取景地**：\"玛丽之家\"作为郑智荣（林允儿 IM YOON-AH 饰）现代韩国公寓的拍摄场景——为已有的韩剧拍摄履历再添一笔（《贝多芬病毒》2008、《个人趣向》2010、《秘密花园》2010、《来自星星的你》2013、《文森佐》2021）"],"timeUsed":["入场及快速定向游览","漫步彩色街道，参观16栋建筑展览及拍照打卡点（约45分钟）","可选择观看木偶表演或奥尔格演示（如有安排）","在现场小吃摊或咖啡店享用轻食","可选延伸参观毗邻匹诺曹与达芬奇意大利村（约45分钟，联票成人₩19,500）"],"whyOnRoute":"小法国村被安排在最后，原因不只是它是什么，更是它在哪里：村子位于清平湖畔，方向已经朝着首尔，所以在这里待一小时不会多开一段路。它也明显是全天最小的一站 — 山坡上十六栋建筑，不到一小时就能走完 — 在岛上待两小时、在花园待九十分钟之后，用它收尾正合适。《来自星星的你》《秘密花园》与《贝多芬病毒》的剧迷会一眼认出这里。","visitBasics":{"hours":"09:00-18:00，最后入场 17:00；闭园时间随季节调整，部分安排夜间活动的日子也会变动","closed":"全年开放","admission":"成人 ₩12,000 — 本行程已包含。与相邻的匹诺曹与达芬奇意大利村的联票（成人 ₩19,500）不包含在内；本行程的这一小时只涵盖小法国村","walking":"轻松 — 缓坡上的小村落，不到一小时即可从容走完"},"convenience":{"restroom":"现场购票","parking":"免费停车"},"smartNotes":{"photo":"粉彩色调的木架结构房屋与翠绿山景交相辉映，是最具代表性的拍照场景。山顶观景台可拍摄最佳全景构图。对于韩剧迷来说，寻访剧中取景地是一项有趣的导览活动（圣埃克苏佩里楼 = 《来自星星的你》关键场景所在地）。","facilities":"园内仅有小吃摊位——华夫饼、饺子、鱼饼汤、咖啡。大多数游客选择在毗邻的意大利村或附近的清平小镇用餐。","tip":"建议搭乘加平城市观光巴士，将此地与南怡岛和/或晨静树木园组合游览，适合自助旅行。下午晚些时候抵达可同时欣赏日间风光与傍晚灯光。期待大型景区的游客可能会觉得规模较小（通常游览1.5至2小时）——请提前调整预期。"},"_poi_meta":{"poi_key":"petite_france","verified":true,"match":"single_poi","kb_version":"1.27","verified_date":"2026-04-29","note":"POI verified in KB v1.10 (Batch 7) and reused here unchanged.","sources":["Petite France Official Site (en.pfcamp.com — own corpus on founder + 16-building layout + Goseong Youth Training Center)","Korea Tourism Organization (VisitKorea — Petite France listing + 2025 ''Bon Appétit, Your Majesty'' filming-location verification)","Saint-Exupéry Foundation France (international license agreement — Le Petit Prince motif authorization)","Gapyeong County Tourism Office (gapyeong.go.kr — official local-government attractions listing)","Wikipedia (Petite France theme park — corpus on July 2008 opening + Le Petit Prince theme + organizational structure)"]},"image":"/images/tours/petite-france/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-02.webp","images":["/images/tours/petite-france/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-02.webp","/images/tours/petite-france/petite-france-couple-colorful.webp","/images/tours/petite-france/petite-france-ai-pastel-village.webp"],"imageCredits":[{"url":"/images/tours/petite-france/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-02.webp","source":"atoc-korea"},{"url":"/images/tours/petite-france/petite-france-couple-colorful.webp","source":"atoc-korea"},{"url":"/images/tours/petite-france/petite-france-ai-pastel-village.webp","source":"atoc-korea"}],"galleryItems":[{"id":1,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/petite-france/kakaotalk-20260510-222949305-02.webp","location":"小法国村","caption":"小法国村 — photo 1","alt":"小法国村 — gallery image 1"},{"id":2,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/petite-france/petite-france-couple-colorful.webp","location":"小法国村","caption":"小法国村 — photo 2","alt":"小法国村 — gallery image 2"},{"id":3,"type":"photo","src":"/images/tours/petite-france/petite-france-ai-pastel-village.webp","location":"小法国村","caption":"小法国村 — photo 3","alt":"小法国村 — gallery image 3"}]},{"number":6,"time":"≈ 18:30","duration":"≈ 1.5 小时车程","name":"返回首尔（明洞或弘大入口站）","category":"返程下车","description":"约 16:45 从小法国村出发，沿首尔—春川高速公路行驶约 1.5 小时回到首尔。下车顺序与接客顺序相反：**明洞站约 18:30**，随后 **弘大入口站约 19:00**。\n\n两处都是地铁换乘站，之后的接驳很方便，而且这个时间点让晚上完全空着 — 你会在首尔的餐厅开始拥挤之前就回到市区。周五傍晚与周日返程可能在进城路段多花 20-40 分钟；导游会在路上给出大巴的实时预估。","image":null,"highlights":[],"timeUsed":["从小法国村出发（约 16:45）","高速公路行驶，必要时中途短暂休息（约 1.5 小时）","明洞站下车（约 18:30）","弘大入口站下车（约 19:00）"],"whyOnRoute":"以小法国村而不是晨静树木园收尾，正是返程之所以短的原因：村子已经在加平的首尔一侧，大巴一离开就朝着家的方向。把下车顺序反过来，意味着最后上车的明洞客人最先下车。","_poi_meta":null,"images":[],"imageCredits":[],"galleryItems":[]}],"routeFlowStops":[{"name":"接客（弘大 / 明洞）","type":"origin","theme":"Seoul pickup"},{"name":"南怡岛","type":"primary","theme":"K-drama island"},{"name":"加平午餐","type":"secondary","theme":"Lunch break"},{"name":"晨静树木园","type":"primary","theme":"Themed garden"},{"name":"小法国村","type":"primary","theme":"French village"},{"name":"返回首尔","type":"return","theme":"Drop-off"}],"routePhases":[{"phase":"首尔 → 加平","duration":"≈ 1.5 小时","description":"07:30 弘大 / 08:00 明洞接客，随后向东北行驶约 1.5 小时抵达加平码头，再搭乘五分钟渡轮前往南怡岛。"},{"phase":"南怡岛","duration":"≈ 2 小时","description":"平坦的林荫大道、《冬季恋歌》水杉小径、江边长椅，以及自由活动的鸵鸟与孔雀。往返渡轮与南怡共和国签证费均已包含。"},{"phase":"午餐 → 晨静树木园","duration":"≈ 2.5 小时","description":"在加平当地餐厅用午餐（费用自理 — 这里是辣炒鸡排的故乡），之后向内陆爬坡约 35 分钟抵达晨静树木园，用 90 分钟走遍各主题园区。"},{"phase":"小法国村 → 首尔","duration":"≈ 2.5 小时","description":"约 45 分钟下行至清平湖畔，在小法国村停留一小时，随后约 1.5 小时车程返回首尔 — 明洞约 18:30，弘大约 19:00。"}],"routeShapeIntro":{"title":"这一天在首尔近郊的走法","subtitle":"07:30 弘大 / 08:00 明洞接客，向东北行驶约 1.5 小时，在一日游人潮变密之前就登上前往南怡岛的渡轮。在加平镇吃过午餐后，路线转向内陆爬坡前往晨静树木园，最后再下到清平湖畔的小法国村 — 它正好在回程路上，所以最后一站不用走回头路。约 18:30-19:00 回到首尔。"},"whyTourWorks":{"bestFor":["想看韩国乡野风景、又不想爬山的初次访韩旅客","为《冬季恋歌》水杉大道而来的情侣与韩流迷","家庭与年长旅客 — 每一站都是平地或缓坡","想完整走出首尔一天、又希望晚饭前结束的人"],"lessIdealFor":["登山爱好者 — 这条路线没有山，也没有登顶","宁愿慢游一处、而不是走三处的旅客","希望在 19:00 之前就能享受夜生活或市区夜晚时光的客人"],"routeLogicSections":[{"title":"节奏与地理","icon":"route","iconBg":"bg-sky-50/80","iconColor":"text-sky-600","items":[{"label":"先去南怡岛，赶在人潮之前","detail":"加平距首尔只有约 75 公里，07:30 出发大约 10:00 就能抵达码头 — 早于搭乘上午晚些时候 ITX 列车前来的自由行旅客，而清晨的低角度光线还留在水杉大道上。"},{"label":"树木园在内陆，村子在回程路上","detail":"晨静树木园位于上面（Sang-myeon），距江边约 35 分钟车程；小法国村则回到清平湖畔，方向已经朝着首尔。按这个顺序游览，最后一站就不必走回头路。"},{"label":"三处门票，一个价格","detail":"南怡岛 ₩19,000 的签证费（含往返渡轮）、晨静树木园的 ₩11,000 与小法国村的 ₩12,000 全部包含 — 约 ₩42,000 的门票，你既不用排队也不用再付一次。"},{"label":"比雪岳山路线更短的一天","detail":"由于这里没有一处在江原道，大巴在路上的时间约为三小时而不是五小时。这正是这一天感觉轻松、而雪岳山行程感觉漫长的全部原因。"}]}]},"practicalAccordionItems":[{"id":"pickup","title":"上下车地点","preview":"首尔两处接客点：**弘大入口站 8 号出口星巴克 07:30**（麻浦区），以及 **明洞站 2 号出口 North Face 旗舰店旁 08:00**（中区）。","content":["首尔两处接客点：**弘大入口站 8 号出口星巴克 07:30**（麻浦区），以及 **明洞站 2 号出口 North Face 旗舰店旁 08:00**（中区）。","两处接客共用同一辆大巴；请在所选地点提前 5 分钟到达。","返程下车顺序相反：**明洞约 18:30**，**弘大入口约 19:00**。","你的实际行程长度取决于接客点：从弘大出发 ≈11.5 小时，从明洞出发 ≈10.5 小时。"]},{"id":"what-to-bring","title":"穿着与随身物品","preview":"舒适的步行鞋 — 不需要登山鞋，但全天要走 5-6 公里。","content":["舒适的步行鞋 — 不需要登山鞋，但全天要走 5-6 公里。","11 月至 3 月请穿保暖的多层衣物；加平的山谷比首尔市中心低好几度，南怡岛渡轮甲板也毫无遮挡。","相机或智能手机 — 南怡岛的水杉大道与晨静树木园的下沉花园观景点，是大家专程来拍的两个画面。","午餐（₩10,000-15,000）与任何自选项目所需的现金与信用卡。","夏季请做好防晒；树木园环线有很长一段几乎没有遮荫。"]},{"id":"weather-policy","title":"天气政策","preview":"全年运营。","content":["全年运营。","小雨：行程照常进行。三处停留在雨中都成立 — 南怡岛的林荫大道与晨静树木园在湿润天气里确实好看，小法国村也有室内展馆。","大雨或暴风雨：恶劣天气下南怡岛渡轮可能停航。若发生这种情况，导游会延长树木园与小法国村的停留时间，并退还南怡岛门票费用。","降雪：加平的雪比首尔市中心多。大巴在雪季配备冬季轮胎；大雪可能让返程多花一小时。","行程顺序或时间可能因交通、天气或景点营业时间在当天调整 — 导游会在车上确认当天的安排。"]},{"id":"inclusions","title":"费用包含","preview":"首尔两处接客点与相同的两处下车点、空调大巴、持证英语导游。","content":["首尔两处接客点与相同的两处下车点、空调大巴、持证英语导游。","**南怡岛往返渡轮 + 南怡共和国签证费（₩19,000）— 已包含。**","**晨静树木园门票（₩11,000）— 已包含。**","**小法国村门票（₩12,000）— 已包含。**","过路费与停车费 — 已包含。","**不包含：** 午餐与饮料（₩10,000-15,000，费用自理）、小法国村 + 意大利村联票（₩19,500）、南怡岛自行车或电动代步车租借、通往南怡岛的天空线滑索，以及个人消费。","可应要求安排中文导游 — 请至少提前 3 天预订。"]},{"id":"language","title":"语言","preview":"主要导览语言：英语。","content":["主要导览语言：英语。","可提供中文导游服务，需提前3天或以上预约。","全天菜单点餐、路牌识别及市集互动均使用韩语，由导游负责翻译。"]},{"id":"walking","title":"步行与地形","preview":"轻松至中等 — 这条路线没有登山，也没有台阶密集的路段。","content":["轻松至中等 — 这条路线没有登山，也没有台阶密集的路段。","南怡岛：平坦的铺装林荫大道；2 小时内走约 3 公里是常见节奏。岛上可自费租借自行车与电动代步车。","晨静树木园：起伏地形上以铺装为主的园路；主环线大致可推婴儿车通行，不过部分主题园区位于短坡之上。","小法国村：山坡上的小村落，坡度平缓，从容走完不到一小时。","全天步行合计约 5-6 公里，分散在三处停留之间，中间都有大巴接驳。舒适的鞋子就够 — 不需要登山鞋。"]},{"id":"lunch","title":"午餐（费用自理）","preview":"午餐约在 12:15，于南怡岛之后在加平码头一带的当地餐厅用餐。","content":["午餐约在 12:15，于南怡岛之后在加平码头一带的当地餐厅用餐。","这里是辣炒鸡排的故乡 — 甜辣鸡肉在桌上翻炒，最后通常用酱汁炒饭收尾。荞麦冷面（막국수）是经典搭配。","预算约每人 ₩10,000-15,000。现金与信用卡通常都收；码头附近的小摊常常只收现金。","本地区素食选择有限 — 早上告诉导游，他们会提前打电话预约。"]},{"id":"cancellation","title":"取消政策","preview":"接送前24小时内可免费取消。","content":["接送前24小时内可免费取消。","出发前24小时内取消：退款50%。","未出现或错过接车：不予退款——但如在接车时间10分钟内联系AtoC Korea运营团队，若车辆提前到达，司机可能会短暂等候。"]}],"practicalWeatherStatic":{"today":{"temp":"—","label":"请参阅季节说明"},"tomorrow":{"temp":"—","label":"请参阅季节说明"},"_seasonalSummary":"Seoul + Gangwon: temperate four-season climate. Seoraksan is 5-7°C cooler than Seoul year-round. Hot humid summers (Jun-Aug), crisp cold winters (Dec-Feb), with prime seasons in spring (April cherry blossoms) and autumn (October-November foliage)."},"seasonalVariations":[{"season":"春（3-5 月）","description":"4 月初北汉江沿岸樱花绽放，随后是晨静树木园的春季庆典与数万株郁金香。小法国村的粉彩建筑在新绿映衬下最好看。"},{"season":"夏（6-8 月）","description":"南怡岛的林荫大道能提供真正的树荫，岛上明显比首尔凉爽。树木园草木繁茂但闷热、几乎没有遮荫 — 请自备饮水与防晒。7 月梅雨季常有午后阵雨。"},{"season":"秋（9-11 月）","description":"这条路线最强的季节。南怡岛的水杉与银杏大道从 10 月下旬一路变色到 11 月中旬，晨静树木园则举办秋季菊花展。请及早预订 — 这是需求高峰。"},{"season":"冬（12-2 月）","description":"晨静树木园的灯节从 12 月初一直点亮到 3 月中旬前后，期间园区开放至夜间。雪中的南怡岛就是《冬季恋歌》的画面本身。请穿得妥当 — 山谷寒冷，渡轮甲板毫无遮挡。"}],"bookingTrustItems":[{"icon":"check-circle","title":"全程门票费用已包含","description":"南怡岛渡轮 + 晨静苑门票套餐","iconBg":"bg-emerald-50/80","iconColor":"text-emerald-600","body":"南怡岛渡轮（₩19,000）及晨静苑（₩11,000）门票已预付至行程费用中——无需在各景点单独排队购票。雪岳山入园免费（近期已取消收费）。门票总节省：约₩30,000。"},{"icon":"users","title":"持证英语导游","description":"韩国持证旅游导游","iconBg":"bg-pink-50/80","iconColor":"text-pink-600","body":"持韩国旅游组织颁发执照、英语流利的专业导游；如提前预约，可安排中文导游服务。导游讲解内容涵盖雪岳山新罗时代寺庙历史、南怡岛《冬季恋歌》的历史遗产，以及晨静苑创始人的故事。"},{"icon":"shield","title":"价格透明","description":"无隐性购物停留","iconBg":"bg-sky-50/80","iconColor":"text-sky-600","body":"没有人参店，没有免税店，没有佣金纪念品绕道。13小时行程的每一分钟都在景点游览或途中行进——您预订的就是您所体验的。"}],"bookingSupportSteps":[{"timing":"立即","title":"即时确认","detail":"含接送地点选择的预订确认","description":"即时预订确认，含弘益/明洞接送地点选择。"},{"timing":"出发前一天","title":"接送详情","detail":"通过WhatsApp/短信发送精确接送地点及车辆信息","description":"出发前一天发送天气预报、大巴车牌号及任何季节性路线备注（晨静之园灯光节时间、雪岳山红叶高峰期等）。"},{"timing":"出发当天早上","title":"接送确认","detail":"导游在出发前10分钟于接送地点确认身份","description":"导游从05:50起在弘益大学8号出口星巴克等候；从06:20起在明洞2号出口（NorthFace）等候。导游及大巴照片将于前一晚发送至您的WhatsApp。"},{"timing":"行程中","title":"行程中支援","detail":"每个景点均有导游讲解 + 24小时全天运营支持","description":"导游现场讲解雪岳山公元652年新罗时代的建寺历史、南怡岛1944年清平水坝的起源及2002年《冬季恋歌》的传奇，以及晨静之园1992年的构想与1996年的开园历程。"},{"timing":"行程结束","title":"两个返程下车地点","detail":"明洞约19:00 / 弘益约19:30","description":"大巴返程时按相反顺序在两个接送地点停靠。"},{"timing":"行程结束后","title":"评价与后续跟进","detail":"可选行程后评价","description":"行程结束后发送反馈请求；您在首尔剩余行程的餐厅或景点推荐将于当天回复。"}],"staticQuestions":[{"question":"门票真的全部包含吗？","answer":"是的 — 这条路线上的三处门票全部涵盖：南怡岛 ₩19,000 的南怡共和国签证费（含往返渡轮）、晨静树木园的 ₩11,000，以及小法国村的 ₩12,000。每位成人约 ₩42,000 的费用，你既不用排队也不用再付一次。午餐是主要需要自付的部分。"},{"question":"这和同样会去南怡岛与晨静树木园的雪岳山行程一样吗？","answer":"不一样，差别大约是三小时的车程。雪岳山一日游多加了江原道的一座国立公园，意味着 06:00 出发、五小时在路上、全天 13 小时。本行程只在加平：07:30 出发，约三小时车程，用小法国村取代那座山。如果你想要花园与小岛、又不想耗在车上，就选这一条。"},{"question":"全程要走多少路？","answer":"全天大约 5-6 公里，分成三处独立停留，中间都有大巴接驳。没有登山、没有登顶，也没有长段爬梯。南怡岛完全平坦，晨静树木园是缓缓起伏，小法国村是山坡上的小村落。舒适的日常鞋子就够了。"},{"question":"适合幼童或年长旅客吗？","answer":"适合，而且比多数首尔出发的一日游更适合。每一站都是平地或缓坡，最长的一段车程约 1.5 小时，全天 19:00 结束。南怡岛提供自行车与电动代步车租借，走不动可以使用；晨静树木园的主环线大致可推婴儿车通行。唯一需要留意的是全天时长 — 从出门到回来仍然是 11 小时。"},{"question":"什么是南怡共和国签证费？","answer":"那就是南怡岛的门票，被做成签证的样子 — 因为该岛在 2006 年以文化观光概念宣布成立“南怡共和国”，还有自己的旗帜、邮票与入境柜台。实际上它是一张 ₩19,000 的成人票，包含往返各五分钟的渡轮，并且已含在本行程中。"},{"question":"可以顺便去小法国村旁边的意大利村吗？","answer":"本行程内不行。匹诺曹与达芬奇意大利村就在小法国村后方的山坡上，需要购买联票（成人 ₩19,500），另外还要至少一小时。本行程只包含小法国村，并安排一小时停留。如果意大利村对你很重要，我们的加平包车行程可以把它排进去。"},{"question":"下雨怎么办？","answer":"行程照常。三处停留在小雨中都成立 — 南怡岛的林荫大道与树木园在雨天确实很有气氛，小法国村也有室内展馆，包括圣埃克苏佩里展厅与八音盒之家。真正的天气风险只有暴风雨导致南怡岛渡轮停航；若发生，导游会延长另外两站的停留时间，并退还南怡岛门票费用。"},{"question":"晨静树木园的灯节包含在内吗？","answer":"灯节不是单独的票 — 它就在园内举行，你已包含的门票就涵盖它。但本行程是白天行程：我们在下午稍早到达园区，所以在 12 月至 3 月的灯节季，你看到的会是未点亮的装置，而不是亮灯的景象。如果点亮的园区才是你的重点，请告诉我们，我们会为你推荐夜间的方案。"},{"question":"这些停留点拍过哪些韩剧？","answer":"南怡岛是《冬季恋歌》（2002）的取景地 — 水杉大道正是大家专程来站的那个场景。小法国村的作品包括《贝多芬病毒》（2008）、《个人取向》（2010）、《秘密花园》（2010）与《来自星星的你》（2013-14）。晨静树木园也曾作为取景地使用，包括《云画的月光》。"},{"question":"几点回到首尔？","answer":"明洞站约 18:30，弘大入口站约 19:00。两处都是地铁换乘站。周五傍晚与周日返程在进城路段可能多花 20-40 分钟 — 导游会在路上给出实时预估。这个时间是特意安排的，足够早，好让你的晚上空着。"},{"question":"包含午餐吗？","answer":"不包含。大巴在加平码头一带的餐厅停留一小时，你自行点餐付费，通常 ₩10,000-15,000。这里是辣炒鸡排的发源地 — 甜辣鸡肉在桌上翻炒 — 通常配荞麦冷面一起吃。素食选择有限，请在早上告诉导游，他们会提前打电话预约。"},{"question":"有导游吗？用什么语言？","answer":"有 — 一位持证英语导游全天随车。若至少提前三天预订，可应要求安排中文导游。各停留点基本是自由活动：导游负责门票、时间、方位指引与翻译，而不是全程解说。"}],"guestReviews":[],"reviewsSummary":{"averageRating":0,"totalReviews":0,"ratingDistribution":[{"stars":5,"count":0,"percentage":0},{"stars":4,"count":0,"percentage":0},{"stars":3,"count":0,"percentage":0},{"stars":2,"count":0,"percentage":0},{"stars":1,"count":0,"percentage":0}],"highlights":[]},"sticky_booking_bar":{"note":"选择日期与人数，即可查看实时可订状态并完成预订。","price":{"amountLabel":"59","currency":"USD","per":"person","salePriceUsd":59}},"pickup_dropoff":{"primary":{"name":"弘益大学站8号出口星巴克","address":"首尔麻浦区杨花路（弘益大学站8号出口星巴克前）","time":"07:30 接客 / 19:00 下车","instructions":"在弘大入口站 8 号出口正上方的星巴克店前与导游会合。请寻找 AtoC Korea 的指示牌与排队中的大巴。"},"alternates":[{"name":"明洞站2号出口（NorthFace旗舰店）","address":"首尔中区退溪路（明洞站2号出口NorthFace旗舰店）","time":"08:00 接客 / 18:30 下车","instructions":"在明洞站 2 号出口上来的 North Face 旗舰店前与导游会合。"}]},"matching_profile":{"profile_version":1,"is_active":true,"product_id":"seoul-gapyeong-nami-morning-calm-petite-france-day-tour","product_type":"bus","route_type":"fixed_route","destination_region":"seoul_gangwon","region_type":"gangwon_seoraksan","vehicle_type":"large_coach","duration_hours":11,"region_tags":["seoul_mapo","seoul_jung","gangwon_sokcho","gyeonggi_gapyeong"],"theme_tags":["national_park","mountain","buddhist_temple","k_drama_filming","themed_garden","hallyu_landmark"],"poi_tags":["nami_island","garden_of_morning_calm","petite_france"],"pace_level":0.7,"walking_level":2,"scenic_level":1,"photo_level":5,"culture_level":0.85,"relax_level":0.5,"first_time_fit":1,"family_fit":0.7,"senior_fit":0.8,"couple_fit":1,"solo_traveler_fit":0.9,"active_traveler_fit":0.85,"adult_family_fit":0.95,"family_with_teens_fit":0.95,"young_kids_fit":0.8,"senior_active_fit":0.75,"senior_general_fit":0.55,"mobility_friendly_fit":0.4,"stroller_fit":0.6,"one_day_fit":1,"same_day_flight_fit":0.1,"rain_fit":0.5,"value_for_money_fit":1,"iconic_landmark_fit":1,"cafe_fit":0.5,"food_fit":0.5,"nature_fit":1,"beach_fit":0.1,"nightlife_fit":0.1,"shopping_fit":0.25,"no_shopping_fit":1,"local_culture_fit":0.7,"storytelling_fit":0.9,"unesco_fit":0,"intangible_heritage_fit":0.5,"indoor_ratio":0.1,"weather_sensitivity":0.65,"comfort_level":0.55,"budget_fit":1,"premium_fit":0.2,"small_group_fit":0.15,"private_fit":0.05,"bus_fit":1,"price_band":"budget","pickup_base":"seoul_central","return_time_band":"19:00-19:30","duration_band":"13h","min_recommended_age":8,"hard_constraints":{"avoidIf":["mobility_limited","wheelchair_required"],"notIdealFor":["very_low_mobility","young_kids_under_6"]},"walking_notes":["13-hour day with ~4-5 km total walking.","Seoraksan paths rocky in places; Nami and Morning Calm flat.","Closed-toe shoes recommended.","Cable car at Seoraksan optional and not included."],"keywords":["seoul seoraksan day tour","nami island day trip","garden of morning calm tour","seoul winter wonder tour","seoraksan nami one day"],"synonym_hints":["seoul to seoraksan day tour","korea three signature stops day trip","seoul winter sonata tour"],"seasonality":"year_round","pickup_base_normalized":"seoul","vehicle_type_legacy":"bus_coach","anchor_poi_keys":["nami_island","garden_of_morning_calm","petite_france"],"private_tour_fit":0.05,"customizable_route_fit":0.05,"flexibility_fit":0.2,"fixed_itinerary_fit":1,"national_park_fit":0,"buddhist_temple_fit":0,"k_drama_filming_fit":1,"winter_sonata_fit":1,"themed_garden_fit":1,"history_culture_fit":0.65,"religious_history_fit":0.45,"premium_dining_fit":0.15,"seasonal_fit":1,"winter_lighting_festival_fit":1,"autumn_foliage_fit":1,"china_mainland_market_fit":0.85,"korea_domestic_market_fit":0,"taiwan_market_fit":1,"singapore_market_fit":1,"hong_kong_market_fit":1,"china_diaspora_overseas_market_fit":1,"se_asia_market_fit":1,"us_market_fit":0.95,"europe_market_fit":0.95,"australia_market_fit":0.95,"japan_market_fit":1,"first_time_korea_fit":1,"seoul_day_trip_fit":1,"english_speaking_guide_provided":true,"chinese_speaking_guide_available_on_advance_notice":true,"japanese_speaking_guide_available_on_advance_notice":true},"matching_metadata":{"primary_themes":["gapyeong","seoul_day_trip","k_drama_filming","themed_garden","river_island","french_village"],"secondary_themes":["winter_sonata","metasequoia_lane","lighting_festival","photo_spots","autumn_foliage","first_time_korea"],"best_for":["first_time_korea","couples","photo_lovers","families","k_drama_fans","seniors"],"not_recommended_for":["hikers_seeking_mountains","nightlife_focused_travelers","travelers_wanting_a_short_half_day"],"anchor_pois":["Nami Island","The Garden of Morning Calm","Petite France"],"anchor_poi_keys":["nami_island","garden_of_morning_calm","petite_france"],"competing_products":["seoul-seoraksan-nami-island-morning-calm-day-tour","seoul-private-nami-morning-calm-petite-france","pocheon-sanjeong-lake-herb-island-art-valley"],"reviews_attribution":"New product (2026-08) — no imported reviews; rating starts at 0.","unesco_fit_note":"No UNESCO property on this route. Cultural weight is popular-culture and horticultural: Winter Sonata''s metasequoia lane on Nami Island, a 330,000 m² private arboretum, and a licensed Le Petit Prince village."},"itinerary_variants":[],"_publication":{"schema_version":"v4_canonical","created":"2026-08-04","last_modified":"2026-08-04","version_history":["v1_authored_2026_08_04"],"fix_passes":{"v1_authored_2026_08_04":"New product (owner instruction 2026-08-04). The Gapyeong trio as a join-in-group coach day tour — the join-in counterpart to the existing private seoul-private-nami-morning-calm-petite-france. Donor A (seoul-seoraksan-nami-island-morning-calm-day-tour) supplied the KB-verified Nami Island and Garden of Morning Calm stop bodies plus Seoul-region weather/trust/support blocks and the two-point Seoul pickup; donor B (seoul-private-nami-morning-calm-petite-france) supplied the Petite France stop body. Pickup, lunch, return and all product-level copy authored fresh in 6 locales (scripts/seoul-gapyeong-content/) with de/fr/it/ru staged. Stop admission/hours re-verified 2026-08-04 against operator and KTO sources. matching_profile derived from donor A with the mountain axes zeroed and garden/K-drama axes raised — full KB calibration pending."}},"page_sections":[]}'::jsonb
